Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, then. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I detect even a trace of deceit\Nin your words, I shall end your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should do what you think is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you're not just\Nblindly following orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say that because you\Nwon't know the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But everything you've\Nbeen fighting for as a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knight was planted in\Nyour head by someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows this story,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you knights were called down\Nfrom heaven by Administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pontifex of the church,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to maintain order in this\Nworld and dole out justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But being summoned's the\Noldest memory you knights have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.33,0:00:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what heaven was like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or your childhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:00:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:01:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our memories of heaven have been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.11,0:01:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told the goddess Stacia does\Nthat the moment we are summoned here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get the part about your\Nmemories being sealed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Stacia isn't the\None who did that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.01,0:01:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the Pontifex, and she\Ndidn't block memories of heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your memories of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you knights were born and raised\Nhuman, right here in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a human name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice Zuberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.55,0:01:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your folks raised you in a tiny\Nvillage up north called Rulid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you were eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you went to explore a cave that ran through\Nthe End Mountains to the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you came out the other side,\Nyou touched the ground on accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You trespassed on the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You broke the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice Zuburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a human name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End Mountains. Unruled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:01:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, don't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.97,0:02:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll end up like Eldrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is too late to stop now. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything.
