Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father's the village elder of Rulid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's Gosfut Zuburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:04:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know your mom's name, but like I\Ntold you before, you have a little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Selka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Selka?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were taken away by\Nthe church, she's been worried sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you lived in Rulid, you\Nwere a sister in training?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.03,0:04:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and really good at the sacred arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Selka's a sister in training, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she's working hard to get\Nas good at the arts as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your goal, as you stated,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.85,0:04:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was not treason against the Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but to bring the Pontifex to justice\Nand protect the human realm, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, we Integrity Knights have a\Nduty to protect the human realm as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We defend it against invasion by\Nthe Dark Territory at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you manage to defeat all\Nof the Integrity Knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.57,0:04:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as slay the\NPontifex herself, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.55,0:04:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There would be no one\Nto protect this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let me ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.27,0:05:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Dark Territory invades and all\Nof you knights hit him full force,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's only going to be, what,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little over 30 of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think that's\Nenough to beat him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prime Senator, you need to talk to\Nthe Pontifex about the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day their army gets bigger, it's\Na matter of time before they attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried there's not enough of\Nus knights to take them all on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are Integrity Knights, so use your\Nbrains and figure it out yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are done talking about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust in the Pontifex, do as\Nyou're told, and all will be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Unc - or rather,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander Bercoli had misgivings\Nabout our numbers compared to theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.27,0:05:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aside from us knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Human Empire does not have an army\Nat the ready should war break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, and the reason we don't have\Nan army is Administrator's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because she's scared that\Nif the people had weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they could all rise up against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a war happens, the nobles are\Nsupposed to protect the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she let the upper class get lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And corrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just care about themselves now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world's running out of\Ntime, but it still has a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can get the word out before the\Narmies of the Dark show up, we can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With enough people, we\Ncan build our own army.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is impossible. An army?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just said how corrupt the nobles are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would protect their own\Ninterests before anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, some of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.91,0:06:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're just a small group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not everyone thinks like they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lower class nobles and commoners\Nwould join the fight in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commoners, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we do is hand out the weapons you\Nguys have got stashed here in the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, we teach everyone the same sword\Nskills and sacred arts you knights know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we do that, we could build\Nan army in a year or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.43,0:07:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, at this point, it can't happen\Nif the Pontifex is still in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.63,0:07:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what scares her more\Nthan the forces of the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's people having free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she can't have an army loyal\Nto her, there won't be an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I say, we throw a coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can bring down Administrator,\Nwe'll free all the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we can use the time we got\Nleft to train them all to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.73,0:07:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with any luck, we'll have an\Narmy big enough to stop the invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact these minions are here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.65,0:07:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that alone is proof of the contempt\Nthat Pontifex has for us knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her most loyal servants, and the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.99,0:08:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help, under one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want your word that when I regain my\Nmemory, I will get to see my sister, Selka,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course. You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, when you do get it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not going to be who\Nyou are right now anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice Synthesis 30 The\NIntegrity Knight will be gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all the memories you\Nhave now will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll go back to being Alice Zuburg,\Nthe girl from a village up north.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Selka. Selka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot remember her face, or her\Nvoice, but when I say her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:08:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lips, throat, and heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to say that name\Nall the time. Selka. Selka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know in my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.09,0:09:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.87,0:09:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A father, a mother, a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.27,0:09:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.67,0:10:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you said before that we knights were\Nnot called but created by the Pontifex,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it confirmed what I have suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This body, the one I have been\Noccupying for the past six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was stolen from another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I shall return what was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is what Selka, her parents,\Nand your friend would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sure you would want\Nthat as well, yes? Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I have one favor to ask. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before you return the\Noriginal Alice's memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like you to accompany\Nme to Rulid village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish to visit there, but\NI do not want to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just observe, and if you would,\Nplease point Selka and my family out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grant me that, and I\Nwould be most grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:10:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we restore your memory, I'll\Ntake you back to Rulid to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.23,0:11:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this moment onward,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall protect the human empire\Nand its citizens in earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Alice Alicization 30, hereby\Nabandon my rank as an Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a barcode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.81,0:12:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eye it burns, so I\Nsee symbols, words don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think about anything\Nhurry clear your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening is when\Nyou defy the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it triggered some kind of mental barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what's causing the pain and if you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep thinking about it\Nyour eye will explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.19,0:12:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only are my memories\Nzampered with, but my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.43,0:12:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever did this is evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is the one who burned these,\Nthese words onto my eye, was it her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.95,0:12:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it the Pontifex?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.01,0:12:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a creator, watching\Nthis world from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a god, but not like the\Nones in your creation story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, we knights are their servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have fought endlessly in their name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We protect their world, yet\Nthey do not even trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took my memories\Nof my family and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.31,0:13:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They cast this diabolical hex on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.09,0:13:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To ensure my servitude to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I am the creation\Nof another entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mind is my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I will protect this world\Nand all the people in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless what they want!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is my mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, to break this,\NI need you to hold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:13:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Administrator,\Nand you heartless gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the sake of my mission, and\Nthis world, I hereby renounce you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EUGEO? EUGEO?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's warmer here. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother, is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.11,0:14:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now who else would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my brothers? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly child, don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.39,0:15:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing I remember was\Nfighting Bercouli from the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then a little man appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chudelkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after that, I woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the top floor of\Nthe central cathedral?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is the top\Nfloor, that must be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Eugeo! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.09,0:16:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.81,0:16:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't use the dagger on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.93,0:16:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was saving it for Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pitiful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.75,0:17:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pitiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look so miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like a flower,\Nwithering away in a pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flower? Me? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could see yourself, you'd agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look parched. Starving. For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For love. Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.81,0:17:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am loved by lots of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never known what it\Nmeans to be loved by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you're so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever I had a nightmare\Nand I couldn't sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.01,0:17:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'd hold me and sing lullabies\Nto make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But was that love meant only for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was what she had left over after\Nsharing it with your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.27,0:18:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.81,0:18:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the one she loved the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted her love all for yourself,\Nbut she loved the others more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you hate them so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father, your brothers,\Nthey stole it. Stop it. Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hate my father or my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why else would you attack that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who came between you and\Nthe red-haired girl who loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who loved only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the boy kidnapped her and tried\Nto defile her, you wanted to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.97,0:18:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hated him because he took\Nsomething that was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.41,0:18:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't attack Raios\Nbecause I was jealous of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet here you are, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.19,0:19:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They decided they don't need\Nyou anymore and abandoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, they've forgotten about you. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.37,0:19:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.95,0:19:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still someone who wants me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.83,0:19:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.79,0:19:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice still needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she love you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.19,0:19:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she love you and only you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to have forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.59,0:19:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can help you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have buried the memory deep within\Nyour heart, but I can unearth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Kirito\Nand Alice all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, like, what if he comes\Nlooking? Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:20:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're almost finished. Let's stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bit longer. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.25,0:20:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.39,0:20:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just you, at any rate. Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, she didn't have any\Nlove for you from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.25,0:20:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing like that girl, Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be happy to love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd give you all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you and no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:21:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come closer, Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will show you what love is, and\Nyou can love me as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you give me all of your love, I will\Ngive you all the love I have in return!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the deeper your love is for me, the\Nmore of its pleasures will I then show you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleasures beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that really what love is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thing you trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like money?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Eugeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.05,0:21:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't love!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.30,0:21:56.37,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)\t(4770,4850,\1a&HFF&)}Something starts to overflow
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.30,0:21:56.37,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}Something starts to overflow
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled, Eugeo!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.37,0:22:01.32,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)\t(4650,4730,\1a&HFF&)}Something that's a red, red, shade of rust
Dialogue: 2,0:21:56.37,0:22:01.32,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}Something that's a red, red, shade of rust
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.05,0:21:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love isn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:22:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't give your love\Nto get something in return?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.32,0:22:10.05,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)\t(8430,8510,\1a&HFF&)}I'm a soot-covered tin man
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.32,0:22:10.05,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}I'm a soot-covered tin man
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.28,0:22:21.33,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)}In what was an empty body, a pulse starts beating
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.28,0:22:21.33,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}In what was an empty body, a pulse starts beating
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.33,0:22:29.97,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\t(8340,8420,\1a&HFF&)}You dispelled the evil magic, didn't you?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:21.33,0:22:29.97,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}You dispelled the evil magic, didn't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.73,0:22:37.97,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)\t(6940,7020,\1a&HFF&)}Good night, until we can meet again
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.73,0:22:37.97,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}Good night, until we can meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.53,0:22:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to forget all of your sadness\Nand make love to me till the end of time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.58,0:22:49.72,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)\t(8840,8920,\1a&HFF&)}My chest, which had always lay hollow,
Dialogue: 2,0:22:40.58,0:22:49.72,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}My chest, which had always lay hollow,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will, but not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, my dear, I must\Nhave proof of your love.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.07,0:22:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will trust only in me and\Noffer all of yourself to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.39,0:22:56.61,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)\t(5920,6000,\1a&HFF&)}Has started to hurt so so much now
Dialogue: 2,0:22:50.39,0:22:56.61,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}Has started to hurt so so much now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.59,0:22:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I tell you what words\Nto say, you will say them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.87,0:23:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, initiate the sacred arts.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.17,0:23:09.07,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)\t(8600,8680,\1a&HFF&)}This pain that you left deep, deep in me
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.17,0:23:09.07,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}This pain that you left deep, deep in me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.95,0:23:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.02,0:23:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.01,0:23:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remove core protection.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.75,0:23:17.13,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4\bord4\c&H57260D&\1a&HFF&\t(220,300,\1a&H00&)\t(7080,7160,\1a&HFF&)}Is my heart, isn't it
Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.75,0:23:17.13,NewED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1\bord0\4a&HFF&}Is my heart, isn't it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.99,0:23:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remove?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.73,0:23:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I doing the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.55,0:23:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be sad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.77,0:23:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.61,0:23:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.17,0:23:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into eternal stasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protection.
